        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "核心是核对工单、车辆、轮胎与轮辋信息，再完成检查、修理或更换及记录。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "tire-repairers-and-changers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "适配表现为能发现规格或数量不一致，并在信息不足时停止。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "tire-repairers-and-changers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-tire"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "安全体验只使用TR-6虚构库存标签，不接触车辆、轮胎或工具。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "tire-repairers-and-changers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-tire"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "输出一张匹配表、选择结论、排除理由和待确认项。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "tire-repairers-and-changers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-tire"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
