      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.faq-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "answer": "O*NET 49-3093.00将轮胎修理与更换工界定为修理和更换轮胎；任务资料包括检查轮胎、拆装和修理轮胎、平衡车轮以及维护作业记录。",
                "id": "tire-repairers-and-changers.faq.1",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tire-repairers-and-changers.daily-work",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-details"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "比较相邻维修职业时应核对维修对象、诊断范围、交付责任、设备权限和训练要求；导航名称本身不能证明职责相同。",
                "id": "tire-repairers-and-changers.faq.2",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tire-repairers-and-changers.role-comparison",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial-tire"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "适配证据来自按工单核对对象、发现不一致、保留可追溯记录并在信息不足时停下，而不是体力或兴趣标签。",
                "id": "tire-repairers-and-changers.faq.3",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tire-repairers-and-changers.fit",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial-tire"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "O*NET 49-3093.00软件技能列表包含记录管理、电子邮件、项目估算、电子表格和文字处理软件；该列表不提供自动化率。",
                "id": "tire-repairers-and-changers.faq.4",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tire-repairers-and-changers.ai-impact",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-tech"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "编辑性人工控制：车辆身份、轮胎与轮辋信息、损伤证据、设备状态、作业授权和最终放行均须由受训人员按适用程序确认。",
                "id": "tire-repairers-and-changers.faq.5",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tire-repairers-and-changers.human-control",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial-tire"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "本次核查材料未提供中国大陆轮胎修理与更换工全国单职业工资分布；行业平均工资不能替代该职业精确工资。",
                "id": "tire-repairers-and-changers.faq.6",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tire-repairers-and-changers.china-pay",
                "source_refs": [
                  "nbs-wages"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "美国49-3093精确职业2025年薪中位数37,710美元；O*NET所示同年P10为30,010美元、P90为50,230美元。",
                "id": "tire-repairers-and-changers.faq.7",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tire-repairers-and-changers.us-pay",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-wages"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "BLS 49-3093行列示典型入门教育为高中学历或同等学历、无需相关经验、短期在岗训练。",
                "id": "tire-repairers-and-changers.faq.8",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tire-repairers-and-changers.education-path",
                "source_refs": [
                  "bls-projections-2025"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "OSHA 29 CFR 1910.177要求雇主为轮辋车轮服务提供训练，并规定轮辋拆卸前完全放气、充气时使用约束装置或护栏等要求；适用范围须按原文核对。",
                "id": "tire-repairers-and-changers.faq.9",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tire-repairers-and-changers.risk-boundary",
                "source_refs": [
                  "osha-rim"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "BLS美国49-3093精确职业2025年就业112,200人，2035年预计116,000人，官方净增3,800，增长3.4%，2025—2035年均职位空缺12,900个。",
                "id": "tire-repairers-and-changers.faq.10",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tire-repairers-and-changers.outlook-transition",
                "source_refs": [
                  "bls-projections-2025"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "BLS美国49-3093精确职业2025年就业112,200人，2035年预计116,000人，官方净增3,800，增长3.4%，2025—2035年均职位空缺12,900个。",
                "id": "tire-repairers-and-changers.faq.11",
                "question_key": "career.faq.tire-repairers-and-changers.career-worth",
                "source_refs": [
                  "bls-projections-2025"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "id": "tire-repairers-and-changers.sources.faq.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "bls-projections-2025",
